  title: Needy Augmentation
  author: Kodipher
  description: "A needy, made to be a utility to balance other needy modules.\nMade
    as a module, so that you can force it to appear in your missions.\n\nThe module
    has to be configured through the mission description, otherwise it acts like Refill
    that Beer!.\nSee the manual for possible augmentations.\n\nModule ID: needyAugmentation\r\n\r\nManual
